+$\sup_{|\eta_t|\le r_0}\sum_{m\in\Lambda_0^*}|2\pi m-\eta_{0,t}-\eta_t|^{-3}<\infty$,
+because $\Lambda_0^*$ is two-dimensional.  Hence the plane contributes at
+most $C\|\partial^3G_\delta\|_{\mathcal M}$, where $G_\delta=s_N\varphi_N$ on
+the plane.
